From b67a1153b1a158a898d8d6adc22dfcd5ea609dd9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lakshay Piplani <lakshay.piplani@nxp.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 19:45:37 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] rtc: Add NXP PCF85053 driver support

PCF85053 is i2c based RTC which supports timer and calendar
functionality.

Features supported:
1. Read/Write time
2. Get/Set Alarm
3. Wakeup Source
4. Generate up to 32768Hz clock output
5. Primary/Secondary i2c bus

Signed-off-by: Daniel Aguirre <daniel.aguirre@nxp.com>
Signed-off-by: Pankit Garg <pankit.garg@nxp.com>
Signed-off-by: Lakshay Piplani <lakshay.piplani@nxp.com>

[1] LORE: https://lore.kernel.org/all/20260914141537.3881890-2-lakshay.piplani@nxp.com/
